% expect-error: undefinedresult
% Scenario: an error with no stopped context and no handler override ends
% the job; the report line goes to the error stream.
% Expect: the job ends with undefinedresult; the error stream receives
% "%%[ Error: undefinedresult; OffendingCommand: div ]%%"; "after" is not
% printed.
1 0 div
(after) =
